# Named retention policies, referenced by name from shares.conf so
# each share can keep a different history.
#
# Format (whitespace-separated): name  keep_daily  keep_weekly  keep_monthly  keep_yearly
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Values map
# directly to restic's `forget --keep-daily/--keep-weekly/
# --keep-monthly/--keep-yearly`; 0 means "keep none at that tier".
#
# The three shipped here mirror Cohesity's short/mid/long retention
# tiers - adjust the numbers (and add more named policies) to match
# your actual policies.
#
# name          daily   weekly  monthly yearly
short           30      0       0       0
mid             14      12      6       0
long            7       8       24      7
